WEBVTT

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:16.590
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:27.600
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:33.130
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:38.640
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:43.620
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:49.420
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.380
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:59.800
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:11.110
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:23.360
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.010
"Okumine Hot Springs"

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:42.870
"Bokuto Delegation"

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.480
Hey, Tsujimoto. What's
with all those bags?

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:56.950
Could you do me a favor and
carry this, Nakajima?

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.680
Okay.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:00.920
Nakajima?!

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.150
What the heck's
in here?!

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:07.060
Well, there's my daily
workout gear...

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:10.160
...then there's some munchies and sake
for our party and, lemmesee...

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.740
Oh! The bottles didn't
break, did they?

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.140
I don't believe you.

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:15.230
Hey, you guys.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.410
"Welcome, Bokuto Rifle Association"

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.380
"Eternal Hot Springs"

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.570
Well, some might say
it has character.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.490
I want a word with you!

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.650
Yes?

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:35.280
You said you knew a good place. That's
why we let you make the arrangements.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.360
What kind of place do you call this?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.960
Huh? There's nothing wrong with it!

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:42.190
A quaint little inn surrounded
by nature, great food...

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.530
...and, it's tiny, but they've got
an outdoor hot spring here!

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.230
Can it! Look, this trip
is my just reward...

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.040
...for all of the suffering and hardship
I endured during New Year's.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.770
I've been really looking forward to
relaxing and getting comfortable!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.450
New Year's Eve brings to mind... TV song
contests, the sound of temple bells...

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.450
"Soba;" Buckwheat noodles
...eating soba noodles as you
see in the New Year...

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.350
...drinking ceremonial sake, and eating
traditional New Year's foods.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:04.510
And wearing a kimono to the shrine,
first thing on New Year's morning.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:08.460
But people like us can't spend a normal
New Year's Eve because of our work!

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.690
At the very least, this was supposed
to be a relaxing time...

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.660
...a 2-day/1-night holiday to put your
feet up and have a good rest!

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.560
And what did you go
and do with it?!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.940
Give me back the 2 days and 1
night of my life that I've lost!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:26.980
FILE. 13
BIG TROUBLE AT THE
LITTLE ONSEN

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.250
I'm glad the snow didn't stop
you from getting up here.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.920
Thanks again for
having us.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:37.450
It seems like there are more of you here
than I usually have in an entire year.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.490
I'm very grateful
to you.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.990
Th... Thank you!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.660
Th... Thank you!
It's nice to be here.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.800
Hurry in out of the cold, and
warm yourselves by the fire.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.800
He seems very
friendly, huh?!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.210
And how about my
lost youth...

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:00.310
Listen up, troops. I think you
all clearly understand...

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:03.850
...that normally a trip at this time of year
would be completely inexcusable!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.610
We have traveled far, leaving behind
those at the station...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.590
...no, the entire police force, and
even the citizens of Japan...

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.060
I feel racked
by guilt.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.420
Therefore, reluctantly,
I feel we must...

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.430
He's not gonna!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.330
He wouldn't make us turn around
and go right back, would he?!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.390
After coming all this way?

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.730
But Chief!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.200
I feel that we must conceal the
fact that we are police officers.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.240
You mustn't
tell anyone.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.010
Understood?

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:31.940
Yes, sir!

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.380
Promise!

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:38.950
Ow! That's hot!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.050
Yahoo!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.000
Aoi! I can't
stop!

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.500
Lean on the edges
more!

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:03.900
I don't know what you
mean by that!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.870
You can
do it.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.740
It's so
cold!

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.850
Sorry, gals!
You okay?

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.580
Your face is covered
in snow.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.480
No kidding! I wonder who's
fault that was?!

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.690
I mean... Oh, hello.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.920
I mean... Oh, hello.
You're from Tokyo, I take it.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.690
Yes, that's
right.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:27.200
Then maybe you need a couple of locals
like us to show you around.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.160
Oh, but...

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.330
Ooh! What
a babe!

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:35.870
Tetsu! Play it cool,
would you?!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.000
Tokyo women are
suspicious.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.050
First we have to get them
off their guard.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:44.980
Hey, you two. Are you trying to
pick us up or something?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:50.050
Pick you up?! We just thought we'd
teach you how to snowboard.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.690
All it takes is
hip action!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.890
But we're skiing.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:59.430
Oh, uh... then how about
if you ride our boards?

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.560
Please! Please ride
with us! Okay?

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.170
Stop him!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.000
Stop him!
Aoi!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.300
Pretty please!

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.940
Get a grip on your-
self, Tetsu!

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.440
If you two don't
smarten up!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:15.970
What'll you do?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:20.020
If I told you, you'd be shocked! Do
you know who we are? We're...

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.420
Yoriko!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:27.390
We're... we work in a REALLY
serious profession!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.950
What, like teachers,
or bankers?

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:36.430
You're teachers?
Bank tellers?

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.070
Tetsu! Down
boy! Down!

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:43.970
Hi!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.410
Natsumi!

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.000
Miyuki!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:51.010
She's cute, too!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.020
So? How're you guys doing?

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:52.690
Terrible!

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.050
I'm doing just great!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:54.110
Terrible!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.450
We're going someplace
else, want to come?

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:57.990
Do you think I can
handle it?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.920
Sure you can, no problem. And if
you can't make it, I'll carry you.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.030
Wait a sec!

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:08.590
I watched you two. You seem to know
what you're doing on those boards.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:13.970
Wait, don't go!

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.770
My friend and I are good at boarding, too!
In fact, we're the best in the area.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:24.980
Tokyo gals may be good, but you'd have a
hard time keeping up with guys like us.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:29.850
I suppose we could teach you. But we
don't have much time on our hands.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:33.590
Well okay, okay, if you insist,
then I suppose... Huh?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.590
Hey!

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.130
Nakajima!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:49.700
I finally caught
up with you.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.370
What is it?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.710
Everyone's getting together.
It's time for dinner.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:54.580
What?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.380
What?
But it's only 4 o'clock!

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:00.210
Don't be like that! People around here
go to bed early, and get up early!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.410
If that's what the innkeeper says, then
we'll just have to go along with it.

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:07.890
Okay! Now we've got that sorted
out, let's go back to the inn.

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:08.690
Huh?

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.290
Huh?
Wonder what's for dinner?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.660
Tetsu.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.860
Huh?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.630
Did we just get the
cold shoulder?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.930
Yup. I think
we did.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:23.670
As the two nicest guys in the village, are
we gonna sit back and let this happen?

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:24.780
No, we're
not!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.850
No, we sure aren't!
We're not!

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.540
We're not!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:33.780
We will not!

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:45.200
Cut it out! That tickles! Stop! Stop!

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.370
Look at his funny underpants.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:47.390
Cut it out! That tickles! Stop! Stop!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.490
He's such a goof when he's like this.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:53.640
Cut it out! Stop!

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.800
Chiefy! Can I get
you a drink?

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.710
Tsujimoto! You shouldn't
have too much to drink.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.180
Chief! Let's sing
a song together!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:06.510
Up first, Natsumi Tsujimoto!
Tonight, the Chief and I...

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.920
...will be singing "Bokuto Love Story"
for your listening pleasure.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.020
Go for it!
Yeah!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.320
Really, Tsujimoto, let's not
do this. I can't sing.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:24.430
<i>Tonight, I'm gonna drink. I'm</i>
<i>gonna drink lots and lots.</i>

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.240
<i>Because I'm with the Chief...</i>

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.810
Not there! Not there!
<i>Because I'm with the Chief...</i>

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:31.140
That's really ticklish there, buddy!
<i>Because I'm with the Chief...</i>

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:36.210
Get your hands out
of my crotch!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.510
Hey! Let go of my shorts!
My shorts!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.250
"Scenic Outdoor Hot Spring"

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.060
This feels
so nice!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.800
It sure warms
me up!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.770
This is the
greatest!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.440
Oh. It's snowing!

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.040
Oh. It's snowing!
Hey, yeah!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.910
Well Tetsu, can you
see anything?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.580
Nope. It's too steamy.
I can't see a thing.

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:16.790
Let's move in closer.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.050
Let's move in closer.
Okay.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:23.700
I'm going closer.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.390
I'm going closer.
Right behind you.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.460
So Miyuki, any romantic developments
on the Nakajima front?

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.270
What do you mean, we're not...

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.260
He sure takes his sweet time, doesn't he?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.430
You should go up to him tonight and...
Wham! Put some moves on him!

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.780
Natsumi, you've had too much to drink!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:40.810
Kobayakawa!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:43.540
Nakajima!

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.650
Stop it, Nakajima.
That's too much.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.720
Enough already. Knock
it off, you two.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.490
Mm! I can smell their
shampoo! Ooh!

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.030
Shh! Down boy,
Tetsu!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:30.090
What's this?

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:32.620
What do you think
you're doing?!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:43.310
Tetsu... Tokyo women are a lot
stronger than we thought.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.810
Uh-huh...

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.950
But that doesn't mean
we're giving up.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.480
Uh-huh...

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:53.980
What kind of women
are they, anyway?!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.800
Our only option is to attack
when they're asleep.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.600
What's this? Slippers
outside a room?

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.310
Only a woman would do that!
This is a woman's room!

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:22.950
Yeah, you're
right!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.710
Tetsu. Keep
a lookout.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.110
Me?

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:42.560
This perfume. It's that chick
I met on the slopes today.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.970
I've got a memory
like a steel trap!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:54.310
Mmm! Pardon my
intrusion!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.590
You're sure not
shy, are you?

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:10.320
I'll just have to live up
to your expectations.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:13.100
Here I come!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.510
Keep quiet!

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:29.950
How is he?

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.850
There!

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:39.320
You two again. The nerve! Creeping
into a woman's room like that!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.830
Sure sobered me up fast!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.520
And spying on us in the bath!
Have you no shame?!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.990
That... that... that thing
over there!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.360
That's not
a woman!

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:48.520
What?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:53.200
She has... has a... I... er...
with my own hand!

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.610
Uh, don't tell me that you...

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:57.940
I touched it!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.480
Oh, no!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.050
Wait! I didn't mean
anything bad by it!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.820
We can't forgive you just because
you didn't mean any harm.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.620
Let me explain!

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:17.060
All the young women move out of town.
It's impossible to find a girlfriend.

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:19.390
So you figured you could just
crawl into someone's room?

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.730
Sheesh, enough with the
tears. It's pathetic.

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.430
What shall we
do, Aoi?

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.370
I feel sorry
for them.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:33.440
Aoi seems to be forgiving. Maybe
we should cut them some slack.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.240
Natsumi, we can
let them go.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.380
Aww!

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:38.740
We're sorry!

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.080
What do you know? You
are sincere after all.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.150
Excuse me, but, er...

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.140
Yes?

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.520
I'm impressed by how
strong you are.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:47.650
Who are you people,
anyway?

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.430
Uh...

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.260
Who, us? Well, we're uh... uh...

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.830
Don't let 'em
get away!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.200
That's the ticket!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:11.070
Nakajima? You
shouldn't...

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:14.950
Nakajima?

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.520
You got it!
Go for it!

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:20.990
Oh my...

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:26.890
No!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.800
Geez, what were
you thinking?!

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.230
Oh. Ah...
Sorry!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:33.970
Up you go!

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.770
Huh? Ouch ouch ouch!

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:37.600
Nakajima, are
you okay?

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.940
What'd you come running
in here for, anyway?

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.710
Oh! Oh, yeah!
It's terrible!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:43.310
What?

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.210
All our vacation money
has been stolen!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.150
"Our vacation money?"

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.140
"Stolen?"

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:51.550
Yes! Our vacation
money. All of it.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.460
Say what?!

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:55.330
"Room Sukekubo"

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:58.060
Phew! S... Stinks!
"Room Sukekubo"

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.770
Where did you leave it?

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.930
I stashed it in the safe.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.110
You sure you put it in there?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.800
You sure you put it in there?
Of course I did.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:14.350
I put it in an envelope, put that into the
safe, shut the door and then locked it.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.310
Uh-huh.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:16.940
And the key? Where'd you put that?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:22.050
Hmm? The key? I put it in my pocket,
and hung it right by the safe.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.450
Idiot.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.360
You didn't have to hang it so close.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.330
What? Really, you don't mean?

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.890
What are you gonna do about
everybody's money?

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.030
What should
I do?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.390
Wait a minute! You two!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.160
Who us?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.500
We've got girl problems,
not money problems.

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:42.200
If you want, you
can search us.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.910
They don't look like
they're lying.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.810
But if they didn't
do it, who did?

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.850
If we don't get that
money back...

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.440
...we can be charged with not paying
our food and lodging bill.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.480
Oh, no!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.080
Then they'll know
who we are.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.920
If that happens, it'll be the worst scandal
since Bokuto Station was founded.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:10.360
The Chief and everybody else are sleeping
it off, unaware of what's happened.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:13.600
We have no choice but to
catch the thief ourselves.

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:23.440
Snowmobile tracks!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.380
This place doesn't own one,
does it? Do you know?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.110
No, they don't have
a snowmobile.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.050
They've got a tractor,
though.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.550
Oh yeah, for snow
removal.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.530
So that means...

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.050
...these tracks belong to the thief!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.960
They're still pretty fresh. There's
not much new snow on top.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.800
So if they're still fresh...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.070
...he probably hasn't gotten very far.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:45.890
Natsumi!

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:48.840
Okay! Where's that tractor
you were talking about?!

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:51.070
It's uh... over
in the...

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.140
Show me!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:55.440
What about us?

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:58.050
You and Aoi stay
there and wait.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.580
Nakajima, I wouldn't go out anywhere
with that face of yours if I were you!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:02.890
Huh? My face?

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.690
Huh? My face?
Be careful!

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:07.620
Do I have something
on my face?

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.500
The road becomes one-
way just up ahead.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:25.340
We'll never catch them
at this speed.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.170
I think it's time for me
to do my thing.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.390
Wow! What's that?!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.590
A mini-bike?!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.490
Miyuki and I fixed it up
especially for this trip!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:48.560
Here goes!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.000
That thing flies!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.770
Hey! Come on,
let's go!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.240
Right!

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.350
Is that him?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.450
Damn!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.090
Thought so!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:27.030
There's a cliff
that way!

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.290
You see that?

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.280
I don't believe it!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.530
You're not getting
away!

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.500
Damn it!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.010
Wanna play chicken,
do you?

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:35.770
That's one
for me!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.250
Thank goodness we got
all of the money back.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.590
What a relief, huh,
Nakajima?

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:52.750
I'm sorry, Tsujimoto,
Kobayakawa!

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:54.320
Don't worry
about it.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.960
Boy, I sure had a good
sleep! Huh?

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.790
Hey, everybody's up so early!
Something going on?

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:01.330
No, uh... no, nothing!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.870
Something happen here?

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.030
Ch... Chief!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.190
Chief! A good morning
to you, sir!

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:08.940
Nothing happened at all, nope!

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:09.970
Really.

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:12.700
Sir, are you okay? You
don't look very well.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.070
I drank too
much.

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:18.010
Feels like my head's gonna
split in two.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.080
We've fallen in love
with you two.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.930
We'll go anywhere with you!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.060
Whoa, back up, there!

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:31.260
We can't have you saying things like that.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.900
Nothing you say is gonna
change the way we feel.

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:35.230
I'm begging you!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:35.790
I beg you!

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:41.700
I'm sure something's
happened...

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:10.840
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:19.440
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:30.460
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:38.560
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:47.360
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:51.810 --> 00:22:56.210
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:56.550 --> 00:23:03.780
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:13.500
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:13.630 --> 00:23:16.600
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:24.670
"New Year's Special"

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:27.270
In Edo, during the
Edo period...

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:29.380
...Constable Natsumi's instincts
are right on target.

00:23:29.550 --> 00:23:31.350
Japanese Maple, Hot Springs, Shrine
Marks and Red and White curtains.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:34.440
All of these are the messages of an
assassin. What do they mean?

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:38.350
Those who stumble upon the truth are
murdered. It's an unsolved mystery!

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.960
Eh? No! Am I gonna
be killed, too?

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:43.290
The New Year's Special will be a
Samurai Cinema Spectacular.

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:45.360
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 14,

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:47.770
"Manju Terror! Natsumi's
Edo Escapade."

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.900
Hey, am I really gonna
be killed?
